<title>USA: Spring Lk Pk ISD 16, Minn $4.660 won by AHWilliams.</title>
<headline>Spring Lk Pk ISD 16, Minn $4.660 won by AHWilliams.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.H. Williams said it won $4.660 million of Spring Lake Park ISD 16, Minn., general obligation tax anticipation certificates, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 3.72 percent.</p>
</text>
